## Predictions (written before the run)
- water rotates like land: zero out-of-season water arrivals; out-of-season fish linger (E26: 150k+) and leave on their own countdown, none die of the boundary
- the feature ledger fights the roster: an out-of-season water arrival, or in-season entries not refilled after the boundary
- the lake fort also dies: the citizen count falls to zero and the run ends on the settlement-crumbled screen, as OCEAN2 did

